      "body": "---\n# Figure 5: NetHack Level 4 and Sokoban Analysis\n\n**Source**: Figure 5, §5\n**Claims**: C01, C02, C03, C05\n\n## Description\nAverage return from Level 4 (top panel) and Sokoban filled pits (bottom panel) throughout fine-tuning. Models evaluated on 200 game saves generated by AutoAscend (agent loaded at the state AutoAscend was in upon entering the level). Measured every 25M environment steps.\n\n## Level 4 Performance (Top Panel)\n- **X-axis**: Environment steps (25M intervals, evaluated every 25M steps)\n- **Y-axis**: Average return from Level 4 (on top of AutoAscend score); averaged over 200 game saves\n\n| Method | Trajectory | Final Relative Performance |\n|--------|-----------|---------------------------|\n| Pre-trained π* (frozen) | Stable horizontal baseline | Reference |\n| Fine-tuning + KS | Starts at π* level; steadily increases | Surpasses π* by end of training |\n| Fine-tuning + BC | Similar to KS trajectory | Also surpasses π* |\n| Fine-tuning + EWC | Roughly maintains π* level with temporary boost | Roughly equivalent to π* |\n| Vanilla fine-tuning | Drops below π*; stays below | Lower than π* |\n| Training from scratch | Lowest throughout | Never reaches π* level |\n\n## Sokoban Level Performance (Bottom Panel)\n- **X-axis**: Environment steps\n- **Y-axis**: Average number of filled pits (Sokoban score); averaged over 200 game saves\n\n| Method | Initial | During Training | Final | Notes |\n|--------|---------|----------------|-------|-------|\n| Pre-trained π* (frozen) | ~60–70 pits | Stable | ~60–70 pits | Baseline capability |\n| Fine-tuning + BC | ~60–70 pits | Maintained | ~60–70 pits (matches π*) | BC uses expert data covering Sokoban |\n| Fine-tuning + KS | ~60–70 pits | Drops to ~0 early | Minor recovery | Online data doesn't include Sokoban early |\n| Fine-tuning + EWC | ~60–70 pits | Drops | Lower than π* | Never recovers to π* level |\n| Vanilla fine-tuning | ~60–70 pits | ~0 | ~0 | Complete forgetting |\n| Training from scratch | ~0 | ~0 | ~0 | Never learns Sokoban |\n\n**Key insight**: KS struggles with Sokoban (deep dungeon level, online policy doesn't visit early); BC maintains it using expert data from entire dungeon.\n"
